window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>It's December, and Declan, Parker and Laurie, a.k.a. The Shifter Stooges, aren't feeling very festive. But when a call comes from Lucius the Vampire King, they are sent on a merry adventure. </p> <p>They must:</p> <p>• Complete the mission</p> <p>• Fall in Love</p> <p>• Find their holiday spirit</p> <p>• Claim their mates</p> <p>• Save the day!</p> <p>And do it all in their own funky, weird way.</p>"; 
